    "status": "Core reconciled-by-hand from Core pp.26-28; Into the Storm 'New Lure of the Void' options reconciled from ItS pp.21-23 (Advanced Origins). Verify vs errata.",
    "scope": "Core options (Tainted, Criminal, Renegade, Duty Bound, Zealot, Chosen by Destiny) plus the Into the Storm 'New Lure of the Void' advanced options (Crusade / Hunter / New Horizons sub-choices). Each ItS sub-choice is its own option record carrying its per-choice xp_cost (ItS p.21: 'pay the xp cost associated with it'). The Origin-Path-table slot substitution ('may select X instead of Y') is recorded as substitutes_for metadata; ItS aliens (Kroot/Ork) use their own background mechanics (ItS pp.49-57) and do not take these Advanced Origin Path Lure options, so each ItS option requires species Human.",
    "rules_qa": [
      "Confirm the requires.species:Human gate on ItS Lure options: ItS Advanced Origin Path is the human path; Kroot/Ork have separate background rules (ItS pp.49-57). Flag if a Kroot/Ork is intended to be able to take Crusade/Hunter/New Horizons.",
      "Call to War (ItS p.22): +5 BS, Peer (Military), Hatred (choice), +1d10 Insanity, 150xp.",
      "Warrior (ItS p.22): +5 WS, +5 T or +5 Ag, -5 Fel, Meditation, 250xp.",
      "Bounty Hunter (ItS p.22): +3 WP, +3 Fel, Bloodtracker, 1d5 Corruption or 1d5 Insanity, 250xp.",
      "Hunted (ItS p.23): +3 Per, Paranoia or Light Sleeper, Enemy, 100xp.",
      "Seeker of Truth (ItS p.23): +3 Int, Scholastic Lore (any one), +1 Corruption, 100xp. Note: same NAME as Core 'Chosen by Destiny -> Seeker of Truth' but distinct effects/source.",
      "Xeno-Arcanist (ItS p.23): +3 Int or +3 WP, Peer (Academics) or Forbidden Lore (Xenos), 200xp."
    ],
